<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>1.0</Major>
    <Description>Rappelz. Running and farming in Ancient Magic Lab with Pets.
Running around and atacking(pets only) in bottom field of Antient Magic Lab (there is 4 fields aroung middle platform with teleport, set up you character at right corner of bottom field). Set up you "Creature Atack" button at "Spacebar" hoykey. Additionaly you can set up some healing at "Ctrl + 5" button (will be used every circle). 100 circle will be done. With ihis macro it will not be obviously that you are botting. Your speed should be around 350. Set you camera pointing at opposite corner of the field (left corner). </Description>
    <Comment>Running around and atacking(pets only) in bottom field of Antient Magic Lab (there is 4 fields aroung middle platform with teleport, set up you character at right corner of bottom field). Set up you "Creature Atack" button at "Spacebar" hoykey. Additionaly you can set up some healing at "Ctrl + 5" button (will be used every circle). 100 circle will be done. With ihis macro it will not be obviously that you are botting. Your speed should be around 350. Set you camera pointing at opposite corner of the field (left corner). </Comment>
